category: Libs
requires: liburcu8 pkg-config
sdesc: "RCU (read-copy-update) implementation in user space (development)"
ldesc: "This data synchronization library provides read-side access which scales
linearly with the number of cores. It does so by allowing multiples copies
of a given data structure to live at the same time, and by monitoring
the data structure accesses to detect grace periods after which memory
reclamation is possible."
external-source: userspace-rcu

